window.products.push({"id":1027019,"name":"Best kitchen Heavy Duty Cooking Scissors for Food like Chicken, Poultry, Game, Meat, Pizza. Herb Cutting Utility Scissor – Multipurpose Dishwasher Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fRO39PvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHARPER FOR LONGER! Similar kitchen shears are often not that sharp, and become blunt very quickly. Our product solves this problem. How? Due to the grade of stainless steel we use, along with new and advanced edge retention technology, you can be sure these latest shears are the sharpest on Amazon, and will remain ultra sharp for longer. 100% GUARANTEED! Unlike some other shears on amazon, our premium shears go through extensive quality checks and inspections both before and after the shears leave the factory. This ensures every pair of shears we send out is perfect, which guarantees second to none outstanding quality for you the customer. SAFE AND EASY USE! Our kitchen shears come with a FREE blade cover, have ergonomic non-slip handles, as well as a micro serrated blade for slip proof cutting, which means these professional shears are extremely safe and comfortable to use. Carry out long kitchen tasks without your hands hurting. Perfect for left handed and people with weak hands. An essential kitchen utensil for people just learning to cook as they are easy function SAVE MONEY as no need for a board or knife! MULTI-FUNCTION! These multi function shears feature a nut cracker within the handle (can be used as a crab claw cracker), and there is also a bottle opener on the blade. The ultra sharp blades mean these cooking scissors can be used to prepare a huge variety of food types such as herbs and vegetables, and for fish, chicken, beef, pork, lamb, BBQ meat and as herb cutter scissors. Great as fishing scissors and for cutting off bony fish fins and bones. VERSATILE! Due to the extreme sharpness of these shears, you can use them for cutting up hard plastic packaging, as well as cardboard, paper and other materials. Can also be used as garden shears for trimming rose stems, as well as for camping and as fabric sizzors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fRO39PvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best kitchen","source_asin":"B07JDBK43S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JDBK43S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JDBK43S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
