window.products.push({"id":1027032,"name":"Gender reveal party supplies (103 Pieces) With The Gender Reveal Balloon, Baby Shower Sash for Mommy, Boy or Girl Banner Decorations, Foil Balloons, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UCZDuRnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Mommy’s & Baby’s Big Day Even More Surprising & Fun With Dreamjoy Baby Gender Reveal Party Supplies! You want your baby’s big reveal to be even more special and we want to help you make it happen. By using bright colors coupled with stylish designs we bring you a baby gender reveal decorations set that will make your big day even more memorable. Dreamjoy gender reveal party décor kit is an all in one set that comes with everything you need to make sure your guests have fun while adding more charm to the décor of your party so you can celebrate the new happiness entering your life in style. The Right Balance of Quality & Style Unlike the rest, we only use thick latex and sturdy foil to make our party balloons to make sure you don’t have to worry about them popping in the middle of the party while making sure they look fabulous. Can be filled with air and helium. The banner comes pre-strung along with pink and blue ribbons giving you the freedom to get creative. The Mommy to be Sash uses a one size fits most design and feels comfortable to wear making it ideal for women of all sizes. Package Includes: 1 x Black Gender Reveal Balloon (Can be filled with Confetti)2 x Pink and Blue Boy or Girl Foil Balloon 3 x Pink and Blue Confetti Balloons 20 x Latex Balloons Pink and Blue1 x Pack of Pink Confetti Hearts and Blue Confetti Hearts1 x BOY OR GILR Gender Reveal Banner 1 x Gender Reveal / Baby Shower Sash for Mommy 30 x Reveal Photo Booth Props / Baby shower props2 x Pink and Blue Balloon Ribbons6 x Team Boy and Team Girl Gender Reveal Stickers12 x Gender Reveal Cupcake Toppers Make The Gender Reveal Party You’ve Always Dreamed Of A Reality With Dreamjoy Baby Gender Reveal Party Decorations and Supplies!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UCZDuRnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamJoy","source_asin":"B07YYRXDW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYRXDW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYRXDW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1027033,"name":"Pampas Grass Large - Natural Dried Grass Decor for Home - Tall Stem Dried Flower Arrangements for Wedding, Home, Kitchen & Boho Decorations by Lessos ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITZiUuCWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform Your Home With Beautiful Pampas Grass Decor What does the perfect dried pampas look like to you? Does it have a full and fluffy texture? Is it bursting with vibrant color? Is it one that you can admire for many years? Unfortunately, most dried grass arrangements rarely arrive at your doorstep this way. Instead, they arrive bent, discolored, and shed immediately. You spend most of your time vacuuming the fragile feathers, rather than appreciating them. What if you could open your dried flower package, and see the thick glorious feathers shooting up in front of your eyes? You can - with our pampas grass natural arrangement. Do you have a dull corner in your home? A neglected vase? Watch as the beautiful plumes restore vitality in lackluster spaces. And here’s the best part: With 3-5 years preservation time, your home will be inspired with long-lasting beauty. Your days of cleaning up broken artificial pampas grass stems are over. Find out why customers love their pampas grass dried flowers ✓ Soft fluffy texture with stunning details to wow your guests ✓ Quality that lasts: unlike fresh flowers that die quickly ✓ Brightens up any space: Modern, boho, rustic, & more! ✓ Perfect for fall/winter decorations Bring The Beauty To All Your Occasions Are you looking for an adorable wedding centerpiece or bouquet? Or would you prefer to uplift your bedroom, kitchen, or living room? Either way, your guests will be marveling once they lay eyes on your flowers. Get your vase at the ready - scroll up and click “Add To Cart’ now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITZiUuCWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lessos Products","source_asin":"B08XYMVKVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XYMVKVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XYMVKVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
