window.products.push({"id":1027070,"name":"Mfacoy Glass Coffee Mugs Set of 6, Clear Coffee Mug 15 Oz, Large Glass Mugs With Handles for Hot Beverages, Clear Mugs for Tea, Cappuccino, Latte, Esp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715i3gJVMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VALUE SET – This glass coffee mugs come in a set of 6 includes spoon. These large coffee mugs are designed with a generous 15 ounce capacity to fit plenty of hot cocoa and lots of fluffy marshmallows. More drinking, less refilling. The ideal everyday mug for enjoying steaming coffees, large lattes, cappuccinos, teas, smoothies or juices. LARGE HANDLE & WIDE BASE – Each glass coffee mug features an easy-to-hold large handle, the large handle can keep it from rotating when you try to hold the mug, which helps you enjoy your tea/coffee comfortably. The wide base design on the bottom of the cup keeps your espresso cup enough to lay flat on the table without shaking it. This latte mug will undoubtedly become your favorite everyday drink cup! SAFE MATERIAL – These clear glass coffee cups are made from heat-resistant and scratch free food grade glass materials, BPA free, lead free, non-toxic and tasteless. A crystal clear look and all lines are smooth and daintiness, creating a nice feeling in hand. Come and grab this glass mug, that matches your style to relish the rich taste of your coffee every day! MICROWAVE & DISHWASHER SAFE – The clear coffee mug can be safely used in dishwashers, microwaves. The wide mouth design is easy to clean, wash away drink residue easily by handwashing the glass mugs with soap and warm water. FOR EVERY OCCASION – Simple and stylish, these glass coffee cups seamlessly complement the look of any event, making them the ideal choice for parties, book clubs, weddings, get-togethers, etc. Suitable for coffee, tea, espresso, latte and more! The coffee mug is ideal gift for coffee lovers, tea enthusiasts, and bookworms!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715i3gJVMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mfacoy","source_asin":"B0BS8DFDGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS8DFDGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS8DFDGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1027071,"name":"Silver Cross Funeral Urn - Cremation Urn for Human Ashes - Hand Made in Aluminum - Suitable for Cemetery Burial or Niche - Large Size fits remains of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nzrNI4fwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liliane Memorials Aluminum Cremation Urns Peaceful Urn in Silver Finish Funeral urn is handcrafted with a hand-etched cross.  Perfect for honoring and remembering a loved one.  Urn will fit well with any decor, particularly on a mantel over a fireplace or in a library. Perfectly sized to fit in columbarium or niche.  The Peaceful urn evokes the memory of your loved one in a traditional religious design. About Liliane Memorial Urns Our handcrafting process results in slight variations in color or finish, making each urn a unique work of art.  Our urns offer a threaded enclosure that allows you to safely and securely handle or transport the urn.  Liliane urns are maintenance free; simply wipe the hand-made aluminum urn with a clean dry cloth.  All of our urns are wrapped in an plush cotton bag and securely packed in a cardboard box.  Capacity: 190 cubic inches; fits the remains of adults weighing up to 200 lbs. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We trust that you will be happy with the quality and design of our products  If you are not happy with the design you selected, please return your unused urn to Amazon for a full credit and select another Liliane Memorial Urn.  Unfortunately, given the personal nature of funeral urns we cannot accept returns after you have used the urn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nzrNI4fwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liliane Memorials","source_asin":"B010EW9A5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010EW9A5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010EW9A5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
