window.products.push({"id":1027093,"name":"Cuisinart Advantage Nonstick 10-Piece Cookware Set, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AaZET48fL._AC_.jpg","description":"A great starter set, this 10-piece cookware collection features a nice selection of essential pieces for any busy kitchen. It includes a 1-quart covered saucepan, a 2-1/2-quart covered saucepan, an 8-inch skillet, a 10-inch skillet, a 6-quart covered stockpot, and a 3-quart covered saute pan. The saucepans come in handy for making breakfast oatmeal or homemade marinara sauce, the skillets offer gently curved sides for flipping food or sliding an omelet or grilled cheese sandwich easily from the pan to a plate, and the stockpot works well for making vegetable soup, beef stew, or boiling pasta. The included saute pan functions like a skillet, but its wide base meets tall, straight sides for extra depth and capacity--exceptionally convenient when making one-dish meals. Start by sauteing onions and browning meat in the saute pan, then add liquid and other ingredients to finish on the stovetop or in the oven. The Cuisinart Advantage Non-Stick cookware line features a pure aluminum core that heats quickly and cooks at an even temperature, eliminating hot spots. Even more, its exclusive Resilience nonstick interior allows for healthier cooking without the need for excess butter or oil, ensures effortless food release, and cleans up in a snap by hand or in the dishwasher. The cookware comes equipped with Easy Grip silicone handles that provide a comfortable, secure grip (riveted stick handles stay cool on the stovetop), and its tempered-glass covers help trap in heat, moisture, and nutrients--plus make it easy to check on food at a glance without lifting the lid. The cookware can be used in the oven up to 350 degrees F, but should not be used under the broiler. Cuisinart covers the set with a limited lifetime warranty. What's in the Box 1-quart saucepan with cover 2-1/2-quart saucepan with cover 8-inch skillet 10-inch skillet 6-quart stockpot with cover 3-quart saute pan with cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AaZET48fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B000PSP714","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PSP714","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PSP714","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
