window.products.push({"id":1027303,"name":"Preserved Dried Eucalyptus Stems, 15-20Pcs 100% Natural Real Silver Dollar Leaves for Vase Filler, 15-17'' Fresh Eucalyptus Plant Branches for Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zGBe5Mx6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☘️[100% REAL STEMS] This is Preserved real Silver Dollar Eucalyptus possesses beautiful large green leaves! Get the look and feel of real eucalyptus, PRESERVED not just \"dried\"! - These stems remain flexible and keep a similar shape and ease of use that fresh stems have. ☘️[Light Natural Eucalyptus Fragrance] Silver Dollar may have a scent, but there is no guarantee of the strength of the scent. The fragrance is much lighter than fresh stems. You can place this eucalyptus bunch in a vase or have it in your shower for aromatic and therapeutic benefits. Enjoy the healing powers of eucalyptus. ☘️[Reminder] These will be sold as 15-20 pcs in one pack, stems vary in length 15-17\". The silver dollar eucalyptus is a natural item harvested from nature, making it common for some leaves to have some imperfections, and each stem varies, leaves sizes to vary. The preserved items are not the true color of fresh eucalyptus and may darken over time but still remain a very close fit to how beautiful eucalyptus is and still feel fresh. ☘️[Easy Care and LONG-LASTING] These silver dollar bunches are preserved and will not dry out. No water needed! With minimal care, these bunches will remain the same for many years! RE-USE / RE-PURPOSE as longer-term home decor after your wedding or event! ☘️[Perfect Decor] These leaves can look stunning in a vase and add a touch of all-year-round greenery to your home. It is perfect for a lasting display, business, or home décor, it makes a perfect gift, wedding décor, floral arrangement, and bouquets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zGBe5Mx6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saipro","source_asin":"B0B391PBRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B391PBRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B391PBRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
