window.products.push({"id":1027488,"name":"COSTWAY Marble Coffee Table, 2-Tier Modern Faux Marble Accent Table with Storage and Gold Finished Metal Frame, Chic Rectangular End Table for Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-NN3FjvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stylish Arched Coffee Table】The coffee table features a white faux marble tabletop that gives a chic and luxurious look. Paired with the sleek golden frame, the contemporary coffee table can match the existing room furniture of different styles and add to a modern flair to your living room. 【Sturdy & Stable Construction】The heavy-duty metal frame with sleek golden finish is rather sturdy, rustproof, and durable. With the arched steel pipes forming a stable and high-strength structure, the accent tea table can support a total weight of 154 lbs (of which the tabletop can hold up to 110 lbs). 【2-Tier Design for Multiple Storage】In addition to the attractive appearance, the living room center table also boasts a functional 2-tier design for display and storage. The spacious tabletop that measures 39.5” x 19.5” (L x W) can be used for holding coffee cups, laptops, vases, while the bottom shelf is suitable for accommodating books and other sundries. 【Thoughtful Details】The steel pipes are fitted with plastic gaskets and adjustable foot pads to prevent scratching and add to the overall stability of the rectangle coffee table. What’s more, the bottom storage shelf is raised from the floor by 6”, which will not hinder floor cleaning but make it easy for the vacuum robot to sweep. 【Easy to Assemble & Clean】The 2-tier cocktail table is easy to put together if you follow the instruction step by step. And the labeled parts are easy to recognize. Besides, the wide tabletop and metal frame are waterproof and easy to clean, just requiring simple and quick daily maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-NN3FjvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0BDLNYYFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDLNYYFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDLNYYFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
