window.products.push({"id":1027553,"name":"Sabatier Cannes Stoneware 14-Inch Divided Dish, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BJX61PMZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Perfect for taking from the oven directly to the table, this French-style, 14-inch, two-section baking/roasting dish is made of thick stoneware and has a gleaming transparent glaze. Its rustic, handmade appeal is heightened by the piping around the dish's rim and identically colored random spotting inside and out. Especially useful for one- and two-person households, the dish is ideal for baking beans, macaroni and cheese, and myriad other dishes in combinations such as chicken and rice in one section and apple cobbler in the other. The dish has two handles, is microwave- and dishwasher-safe, and cleans easily with baking soda and a plastic or nylon scrubber. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BJX61PMZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sabatier","source_asin":"B00005QB5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005QB5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005QB5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
