window.products.push({"id":1027696,"name":"Gaming Chair, PU Leather Computer Chair, Comfortable Swivel Task Home Office Desk Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EaASnNKPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi-function】 Play games in comfort & style with our gaming chair! With our gaming chairs, you can recline and relax while you play, and our footrest will make your experience even better. With 90° to 155° reclining and adjustable backrest, these chairs will make sure that you're comfortable while you play. 【Ergonomic Design】This leather office chair features wide seats/back for extra comfort for a long time working or playing games, An easy opportunity to eliminate any back pain that you may experience due to sedentary sitting. Ergonomic design fully supports the back, protects the spine, and creates a scientific and healthy sitting posture. 【Comfy Seat】Gamers want their gaming chair to be more than a seat. They want it to be a comfortable seat with an ergonomic back design for long hours of sitting. The Ergonomic Gaming Chair offers favorite resilience and breathability with a high-density foam cushion and bonded leather. Let this seat take care of you while you take care of things. 【Durable Performance】Our high-back computer chair comes with all hardware and necessary tools and commercial-grade components, easy to assemble, It only takes 15-20 minutes to assemble. With a sturdy metal base frame, maximum supports up to 300lbs. 360° rotating caster ensures you can move smoothly on the floor 【Space-Saving】The perfect blend of design, ergonomics, and functionality. This chair is designed for adults and has a space-saving footrest that you can stow up and put the chair under the desk. The racing chair has all of the features you need while also looking good in your gaming room, office, or study room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EaASnNKPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLIXIS","source_asin":"B09WMS8YGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMS8YGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMS8YGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1027697,"name":"Puppy Birthday Party Supplies for Kids (24-Count) - Mini Aussie Australian Shepherd Dog Party Decorations with Cups, Napkins, 9-in Dinner Dog Plate & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91--pVIajBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don't settle for boring, flimsy party supplies. It's just not worth the hassle. I would know. I'm a culinary school trained chef who's catered countless weddings, showers, and events. Relying on flimsy paper products only leads to leaky cups, shredded tablecloths, and toppled over plates. No one’s idea of a good time. Unfortunately, finding reliable, cute paper products is no easy feat. Especially for childrens’ parties. And, let’s be honest, sugared-up kids need durable paper goods more than most . That’s why I’ve used my years of experience as a parent and a caterer to create sturdy, adorable Australian Shepherd puppy themed birthday party supplies . Kids love their bold color and smiling, blue-eyed Mini Aussie doggie design. Parents love how they keep party messes to a minimum. What Else Can You Expect from Our Aussie Puppy Party Supplies? Convenient, all-in-one 98-piece tableware party pack High-definition, fade-resistant Mini Aussie with blue eyes Fun teal accent colors with bone, heart, and paw-print shapes 24 absorbent 2-ply napkins 24 leak-resistant paper cups for cold and warm (not hot) beverages 2 rectangular plastic tablecloths that cover 6-foot-long tables 24 of each: heavy-weight 9-in. dinner plates & 7-in. dessert plates And, when I say heavy-weight, I mean it ! Moms, dads, and grandparents trust these lovable dog plates to hold pizza, chips, subs, brownies, thick slices of birthday cake, and more. No flopping or folding here! Plus, a rimmed edge keeps goodies contained as kids move about. Simply “ Add to Cart ” today to make your next party your best party !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91--pVIajBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MJ GREEN EVENTS","source_asin":"B06X9ZNRP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X9ZNRP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X9ZNRP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
