window.products.push({"id":1027702,"name":"Diamond Heart Silicone Cake Mold Trays 8.7 Inch with 2 Pieces Wooden Hammers, 2 Pieces Silicone Ice Lolly Molds 4 Cavities Ice Lolly Molds with 50 Pie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ypR46-hPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sufficient quantity: our package comes with 1 piece large diamond heart cake molds measuring approx. 8.7 x 7.9 x 2.2 inch/ 22 x 20 x 5.5 cm, 2 pieces 4 cavities silicone molds measuring about 8.3 x 3.3 x 0.9 inch/ 21 x 8.4 x 2.2 cm, equipped with 2 pieces wooden hammers, 50 pieces wooden sticks, and 2 pieces chocolate molds in 2 shapes for cake decorations Reliable material: these cake mold trays are made of quality silicone which is safe to use, tasteless, non-toxic, flexible, dust resistant, reusable, non-stick and easy to clean, can be applied within the temperature between -40℉ - 230℉, while the hammers and the sticks are both made of quality wood material without toxic and taste, you can use them at ease Scope of usages: the silicone cake mold set is suitable for gum paste, jelly, muffin, fondant, sugar paste, melted chocolate, cheese cake, wax, ice, soap, resin, baking and more types of moulding clays, also smart to use it as tray to make juice, and the molds are not only nice to create frozen treats in summer, but also applied to get your own delicious desserts in winter Easy to use: these tools help you to bake with less time and effort, you just need to mix ingredients and pouring it into a mold, then form a beautiful shape as your want, non-stick surface handling will release food without struggle, allowing professional bakers and home bakers to work easily with good quality Warm notice: do not direct contact with an open flame or near heat sources (such as toaster heating pipes), it is recommended that when you bake, mold placed in the middle or upper position of the oven, maintain a spacing of at least 5 cm with tubular heating elements","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ypR46-hPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patelai","source_asin":"B08L6GLF3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L6GLF3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L6GLF3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
