window.products.push({"id":1027715,"name":"FARIDA BEDDING Cooling Bamboo Mattress Pad with Fitted Skirt - Ultra Soft Cool Touch Mattress Pad Cover - Extra Plush Hypoallergenic Fill Pillow Top R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sIgoSNqaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOLING, BREATHABLE & ULTRA SOFT: Made of premium quality Rayon from Bamboo top and innovative down alternative fill. This hotel quality mattress pad is perfect for people who love the softness of down and Bamboo surface. The breathable Bamboo fabric features good ventilation and allows for effective air flow to diminish overheating and regulate temperature. This cooling mattress topper will wick away sweat and keep you perfectly cool and comfortably warm. Great for the hot memory foam mattress. EXTRA PLUSH - LUXURIOUS COMFORT: Generously filled with 600GSM innovative mixture of 0.9D Microfiber and 7D Hollow Fiber for optimum plushness and cooling. Thicker than standard mattress pads. This extra plush mattress topper offers perfect support for your shoulders and hips, distributes weight evenly and alleviates pressure points, and allows you to sleep soundly and wake up without back pain. Excellent way to restore the comfort of an old mattress or improve the quality of new mattress. HEALTHIER SLEEP & OPTIMUM PATTERN DESIGN: Our innovative down alternative fill has no odors unlike the unpleasant odors emitted by feather down or memory foam topper. The cooling mattress pad is hypoallergenic and uses skin-friendly Bamboo fabric. The Baffle Box design keeps the fill material in place and prevents it from shifting or bunching in one area, offering uniform body support from head to toe. This pillow top mattress topper provides the best solution for a healthier sleep. ELASTIC FITTED DEEP POCKET: The mattress cover has an elastic deep pocket which works like a fitted sheet. The skirt will securely attach the pillow top pad to the mattress, preventing the Bamboo mattress topper from shifting in the night no matter how you toss and turn on your bed. The deep pocket can hold any mattress (8”-21”) whether it has low or high profile. Twin 39\"x75\", Twin XL 39\"x80\", Full 54\"x75\", Queen 60\"x80\", King 78\"x80\", Cal King 72\"x84\". IDEAL GIFT & EASY CARE CONVENIENCE: The Bamboo topper is an ideal gift for housewarming, baby shower, weddings, anniversary, and birthdays. It’s machine washable, no expensive dry cleaning is required. Simply wash it in cold water and tumble dry on the low setting. The backing material is a sturdy 100% microfiber fabric to keep the topper in an outstanding condition after several washes. Should you experience any issue with the pad, please contact us and we will make every effort to help you. Important Tips: The product is packaged in a vacuum bag. After receiving, we recommend drying it into the tumble dryer to fluff it up. Also, you can spread it for a few days or lay it under the sun for a few hours so that it returns to the normal thickness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sIgoSNqaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FARIDA BEDDING","source_asin":"B08RYPKT5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYPKT5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYPKT5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
