window.products.push({"id":1027740,"name":"lEPECQ Votive Candle Holders, Decorative Votive Candle Holders 3.14\" H - Matte Red and Gold (Set of 4) - Party Candle Holder for Valentines Day Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1Kt6Qc5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"VOTIVE CANDLE HOLDERS SIZE- Each of the Christmas Candle Holder has 2.95” diameter (top) and 3.14”height approximately (set of 4) CHRISTMAS UNIQUE DESIGN - Our Matte Red and Gold votive candle holders could transform candles into twinkling works of four different Christmas elements. Their motifs are Christmas trees, reindeer, snowflakes and stars. CHRISTMAS CANDLE HOLDER GIFT - Add glow and warmth to your Christmas décor, and other Christmas theme events, hotel, café or spa by placing your favorite candles inside our Glass Votive Candles Holder during Christmas! It's the best gift for Christmas. CHRISTMAS CANDLE HOLDERS - Our votive candle holders to be used with traditional wax candle/ a tealight candle , and these easy to clean candle holders perfectly contain all hot melting wax. CHRISTMAS VOTIVE HOLDERS - NOTE Wax Tea Light Candles are NOT included. If any quality problems with this tealight candle holder, please contact us directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1Kt6Qc5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lEPECQ","source_asin":"B07FKBP1YZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FKBP1YZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FKBP1YZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1027741,"name":"Cut and Polished Geode Half-Premium Quality Septarian Geode-Beautiful Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kx3HPkH-L._AC_SL1128_.jpg","description":"This listing is for 1 premium quality Septarian geode half. Approx 4\" face. You will receive one similar in quality and size to pictures. This rare geode is a beautiful, interesting, and unique home decor piece. One that gets noticed and is great for conversation. Septarians are unique because they are a sedimentary geode. Most others are Igneous. Septarians formed on the bottom of the sea floor. Through tidal action mud balls mixed with sea shells begin to form. As the water would recede these mud balls would crack. Water would return and deposit more minerals along with the decaying sea shells which were releasing calcium carbonite. Over millions of years these beautiful geodes formed crystal calcite centers with dark aragonite lines and grey limestone exterior. They are from Utah USA. Cut and polished in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kx3HPkH-L._AC_SL1128_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Geode Mine","source_asin":"B08K9FNFDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K9FNFDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K9FNFDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
