window.products.push({"id":1027798,"name":"Que Sera Sera Artwork by Carrie Schmitt, 18 x 18\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8129YEbXRHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a painting of colorful flowers in vases. Carrie Schmitt has loved flowers since her childhood and today paints them as part of her mission to create beauty every day. Because of a life-threatening allergy to heat, Carrie began painting in 2009 since she is no longer able to spend time in her garden. Carrie now lives in Seattle in a studio surrounded by mountains. She plans to start offering art retreats in the beautiful Pacific Northwest soon. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8129YEbXRHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B011OAS3VW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011OAS3VW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011OAS3VW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
