window.products.push({"id":1027912,"name":"Pure Country Weavers - Holy Spirit White Dove Luke 3:22 Hand Finished European Style Jacquard Woven Wall Tapestry. USA Size 26x34","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pB2lrZJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The symbol of peace is the focal point of this art by Sawyer. A beautiful white dove fly’s in a night sky accentuated with purple hues and twinkling stars. A bible phrase is woven in this lovely piece of art. Specifications This Wall Tapestry is 34 inches wide by 26 inches tall, and is woven from 100% cotton. Pure Country Weavers We are the world’s largest weaver of expertly crafted throw blankets, pillows, tote bags, and wall tapestries. Pure Country Weavers is dedicated to providing artisan quality home décor items to boutique stores worldwide. Soft to the touch and providing a warm, welcoming embrace, our blankets bring comfort to our clientele all over the world. Our Jacquard woven blankets are available in thousands of designs including over 200 breeds of Dogs, Cats, Horses and other animals. We are licensed to weave for over 500 Colleges, Universities, Fraternities and Sororities, We offer woven art depicting everything from Angels to Zebras. There is something here for everyone. All of our Pure Country Weavers designs are woven in the USA using advanced Jacquard weaving techniques, allowing us to generate a depth and texture not found in traditional home decor. · This Wall Hanging is WOVEN \"old school\" by third generation North Carolina weavers on Mechanical Looms and HAND FINISHED for uniqueness; Unique CONVERSATION PIECE · Miles of colored thread come together to create a perceptible and tangible TEXTURE and WARMTH to the art; The quality and intricate nature of the piece is unbelievable · NOT PRINTED, The woven texture adds dimensionality to the art which when viewed at a subtle distance creates major VISUAL IMPACT; Creates a focal point to a room · Tapestries are incredibly DURABLE; can be moved, shipped, stored, touched dropped ironed or vacuumed; LARGE art for great big spaces · 100% Cotton; Hang using brass furniture tacks (included) for a modern snug to wall look; Rod pocket sewn on back for traditional hanging; rod not included; Made in the USA · Carefully woven and sewn with care and attention to detail Width: 34 Height: 26 UPC: 666576695806","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pB2lrZJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Country Weavers","source_asin":"B01HUJCJHU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1027912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HUJCJHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HUJCJHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
